# What the Flask systems image's build may see. Everything is excluded unless listed, and
# then what no image needs is excluded again: tests, caches, environments, .env files and
# service keys never reach an image, and nor does generated data (data/generated is
# git-ignored, and the image makes its own on the box).
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!python/**
!services/*/pyproject.toml
!services/flask-systems/**
!data/seed/lb05/**
!infra/docker/python-entrypoint.sh
!infra/docker/python-healthcheck.py
!infra/docker/flask-seed.py

**/tests
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.jwk.json
